"{{Term/Store|Lynel Safari||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Lynel Safari}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Zora's Domain}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
Once [[Link]] has spoken with [[Sidon]] and [[Muzu]] in front of [[Mipha's Statue]] during the "[[Divine Beast Vah Ruta]]" [[Main Quest]], he can speak to [[Laflat]] to obtain this [[Side Quest]]. She explain to Link that she overheard Sidon exclaiming that he and Link were going to stop [[Divine Beast Vah Ruta]]'s flow of water.<ref>{{Cite|Prince Sidon ran off through the eastern gate. He was shouting something like... "I'm off to stop the Divine Beast! Link the Hylian is coming with me!" I assume that means you're going up {{Color BotW|Blue|Ploymus Mountain}} in search of {{Color BotW|Blue|shock arrows}}?|Laflat|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|When Link obtains this Side Quest after completing the "[[Divine Beast Vah Ruta (Quest)|Divine Beast Vah Ruta]]" Main Quest, Laflat tells him that there is still a threat to Zora's Domain.<ref>{{Cite|Link... The Divine Beast has been appeased, but I fear there is still something that threatens the domain...|Laflat|BotW}}</ref> Her explanation afterwards is the same.}} To capitalize on his venture up [[Ploymus Mountain]], Laflat asks Link to capture a [[Picture]] of a [[Lynel]].<ref>{{Cite|[Yes.] If so, I have a request that is...somewhat related. There's a red-maned monster called a {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}} that lives on {{Color BotW|Blue|Ploymus Mountain}}. I REALLY need a picture of a {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}}. It can be a picture of any red-maned {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}}. Not just the one on the mountain. So what do you say? Can you get me a picture of a {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}}?|Laflat|BotW}}</ref> Laflat further explains that she requires a Picture in order to scare off any would-be divers that are seeking to dive from [[Shatterback Point]] after being goaded by [[Gruve]].<ref>{{Cite|[Understood!] I am glad that was settled so quickly. See, there's this fool in the domain who goads people into jumping off of {{Color BotW|Blue|Shatterback Point}} on {{Color BotW|Blue|Ploymus Mountain}}. It's an incredibly dangerous jump, and this guy pressures people into jumping off by questioning their courage. He's a real bottom-feeder. If this keeps up, someone is surely going to wind up horribly injured! I need a picture of a {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}} to show everyone how scary they are. That way, maybe people will stop going up there. Does that answer your question, Link? I'll leave the details to you. Just bring me a {{Color BotW|Red|picture of a Lynel}} so I can describe them in terrible detail. Thank you!|Laflat|BotW}}</ref>

In order to fulfill Laflat's request, Link must capture a Picture of any red-maned Lynel. As the nearest Lynel to Zora's Domain is the one atop Ploymus Mountain, she directs Link there.<ref>{{Cite|Laflat asked that you {{Color BotW|Red|show her}} a picture of a red-maned {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}} if you see one. The nearest one she knows of is on Ploymus Mountain.<br/><br/>Use whatever means you have at your disposal to give her a look.|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

Once Link has taken a suitable Picture, he can return to Laflat and show it to her.<ref>{{Cite|Link! How is that {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}} mission coming along?|Laflat|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|[I have your picture.] Oh, wow! Please show me!|Laflat|BotW}}</ref> Upon seeing it, she will exclaim in fright before excusing herself.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|WAAAH?!}} *ahem* My apologies... That sound was not very dignified, was it? P-pardon me... I'm all better now. That {{Color BotW|Red|Lynel}}... How terrifying! One look at this, and I doubt anyone would get any reckless ideas about visiting {{Color BotW|Blue|Ploymus Mountain}}!|Laflat|BotW}}</ref> She then thanks Link for providing a suitably scary Picture and offers him the [[Zora Greaves]] in return.<ref>{{Cite|Thank you! I'll tell the children of the domain about this. Maybe that will scare them away from the mountain. Oh, right! Now for your reward...|Laflat|BotW}}</ref> With this, the Side Quest is marked as completed.

